dow: none;\n        transform-origin: top left;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"top-rule\"></div>\n    <div class=\"unit\">6　分数的加法和减法</div>\n    <h1>第 2 课时　 第 1 课时练习课</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"columns\">\n      <section class=\"column left\">\n        <div class=\"section-title\">1.填一填。</div>\n\n        <div class=\"question\">\n          (1)\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span>4</span><span>11</span></span>＋\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span>5</span><span>11</span></span>\n          表示（<span class=\"hand\">4</span>）个\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span>1</span><span>11</span></span>\n          加上（<span class=\"hand\">5</span>）个\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span>1</span><span>11</span></span>，是（<span class=\"hand\">9</span>）个\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span>1</span><span>11</span></span>，就是（<span class=\"hand\"><span class=\"frac\"><span>9</span><span>11</span></span></span>）。\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"question\">\n          (2)计算\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span>2</span><span>3</span></span>－\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span>1</span><span>2</span></span>\n          时，因为两个分数的（<span class=\"hand\">分母</span>）不同，不能直接相减，所以应先（<span class=\"hand\">通分</span>），化成（<span class=\"hand\">同分母</span>）分数再相减。\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"question\">\n          (3)比\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span>4</span><span>5</span></span> m\n          长\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span>3</span><span>8</span></span> m\n          的是（<span class=\"hand\"><span class=\"frac\"><span>47</span><span>40</span></span></span>）m。\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"question\">\n          (4)分数单位是\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span>1</span><span>8</span></span>\n          的最简真分数有（<span class=\"hand\">\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span>1</span><span>8</span></span>，\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span>3</span><span>8</span></span>，\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span>5</span><span>8</span></span>，\n          <span class=\"frac\"><span>7</span><span>8</span></span></span>），它们的和是（<span class=\"hand\">2</span>）。\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section-title\">2.算一算。</div>\n        <div class=\"calc-grid\">\n          <div class=\"calc\">\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>5</span><span>8</span></span>－<span class=\"frac\"><span>7</span><span>12</span></span>\n            <span class=\"work\"><span class=\"frac\"><span>15</span><span>24</span></span>－<span class=\"frac\"><span>14</span><span>24</span></span>＝<span class=\"frac\"><span>1</span><span>24</span></span></span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"calc\">\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span>4</span><span>5</span></span>\n            <span class=\"work\"><span class=\"frac\"><span>5</span><span>15</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span>12</span><span>15</span></span>＝<span class=\"frac\"><span>17</span><span>15</span></span></span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"calc\">\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>2</span><span>3</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span>1</span><span>4</span></span>\n            <span class=\"work\"><span class=\"frac\"><span>8</span><span>12</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span>3</span><span>12</span></span>＝<span class=\"frac\"><span>11</span><span>12</span></span></span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"calc\">\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>2</span><span>3</span></span>－<span class=\"frac\"><span>3</span><span>5</span></span>\n            <span class=\"work\"><span class=\"frac\"><span>10</span><span>15</span></span>－<span class=\"frac\"><span>9</span><span>15</span></span>＝<span class=\"frac\"><span>1</span><span>15</span></span></span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"calc\">\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>2</span><span>3</span></span>－<span class=\"frac\"><span>5</span><span>9</span></span>\n            <span class=\"work\"><span class=\"frac\"><span>6</span><span>9</span></span>－<span class=\"frac\"><span>5</span><span>9</span></span>＝<span class=\"frac\"><span>1</span><span>9</span></span></span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"calc\">\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>3</span><span>7</span></span>－<span class=\"frac\"><span>2</span><span>9</span></span>\n            <span class=\"work\"><span class=\"frac\"><span>27</span><span>63</span></span>－<span class=\"frac\"><span>14</span><span>63</span></span>＝<span class=\"frac\"><span>13</span><span>63</span></span></span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"calc\">\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>2</span><span>3</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span>5</span><span>9</span></span>\n            <span class=\"work\"><span class=\"frac\"><span>6</span><span>9</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span>5</span><span>9</span></span>＝<span class=\"frac\"><span>11</span><span>9</span></span></span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"calc\">\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>3</span><span>8</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span>7</span><span>12</span></span>\n            <span class=\"work\"><span class=\"frac\"><span>9</span><span>24</span></span>＋<span class=\"frac\"><span>14</span><span>24</span></span>＝<span class=\"frac\"><span>23</span><span>24</span></span></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section-title\">3.连一连。</div>\n        <div class=\"matching\" aria-label=\"分数运算连线题\">\n          <div class=\"fraction-box b1\">\n            <div class=\"row\"><span>3</span><span>4</span></div>\n            <div class=\"row\"><span>5</span><span>7</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fraction-box b2\">\n            <div class=\"row\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></div>\n            <div class=\"row\"><span>2</span><span>7</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fraction-box b3\">\n            <div class=\"row\"><span>7</span><span>3</span></div>\n            <div class=\"row\"><span>10</span><span>5</span></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"operation-box op1\">结果大于1</div>\n          <div class=\"operation-box op2\">结果小于1</div>\n\n          <div class=\"fraction-box b4\">\n            <div class=\"row\"><span>2</span><span>4</span></div>\n            <div class=\"row\"><span>3</span><span>9</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fraction-box b5\">\n            <div class=\"row\"><span>22</span><span>2</span></div>\n            <div class=\"row\"><span>27</span><span>3</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fraction-box b6\">\n            <div class=\"row\"><span>9</span><span>6</span></div>\n            <div class=\"row\"><span>14</span><span>7</span></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <span class=\"line l1\"></span>\n          <span class=\"line l2\"></span>\n          <span class=\"line l3\"></span>\n          <span class=\"line l4\"></span>\n          <span class=\"line l5\"></span>\n          <span class=\"line l6\"></span>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"column right\">\n        <div class=\"problem-block\">\n          <div class=\"question\">\n            <span class=\"section-title\">4.</span>一个西瓜，第一次吃了它的\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span>，第二次吃了它的\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>2</span><span>5</span></span>。\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"subquestion\">(1)两次一共吃了它的几分之几？</div>\n          <div class=\"answer\">\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>1</span><span>3</span></span>＋\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>2</span><span>5</span></span>＝\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>11</span><span>15</span></span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"subquestion\">(2)这个西瓜还剩下几分之几？</div>\n          <div class=\"answer\">\n            1－<span class=\"frac\"><span>11</span><span>15</span></span>＝\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>4</span><span>15</span></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"problem-block\">\n          <div class=\"question\">\n            <span class=\"section-title\">5.</span>春天到了，某学校的同学去郊区植树，四年级同学植了总棵数的\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>3</span><span>8</span></span>，五年级同学植了总棵数的\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>3</span><span>5</span></span>。\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"subquestion\">(1)两个年级一共植了总棵数的几分之几？</div>\n          <div class=\"answer\">\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>3</span><span>8</span></span>＋\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>3</span><span>5</span></span>＝\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>39</span><span>40</span></span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"subquestion\">(2)你还能提出什么数学问题并解答？</div>\n          <div class=\"written-question\">五年级同学比四年级同学多植了总棵数的几分之几？</div>\n          <div class=\"answer\">\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>3</span><span>5</span></span>－\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>3</span><span>8</span></span>＝\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>9</span><span>40</span></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"problem-block\">\n          <div class=\"question\">\n            <span class=\"section-title\">6.</span>佳佳做数学作业用了\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>2</span><span>5</span></span>小时，比做语文作业少用\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>1</span><span>4</span></span>小时，佳佳做这两科作业一共用了多长时间？\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"answer\">\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>2</span><span>5</span></span>＋\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>1</span><span>4</span></span>＝\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>13</span><span>20</span></span>（时）\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"answer\">\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>2</span><span>5</span></span>＋\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>13</span><span>20</span></span>＝\n            <span class=\"frac\"><span>21</span><span>20</span></span>（时）\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">— <span class=\"page-number\">69</span> ※</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
